{
  "manifestVersion": 2,
  "id": "the-althing",
  "version": "1.0.7",
  "name": {
    "en": "The Althing",
    "zh-CN": "议事厅"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Convene expert councils in CodexHost projects and publish their findings.",
    "zh-CN": "在 CodexHost 项目中召集专家议会并发布研究结论。"
  },
  "details": {
    "en": "### Inside the council\n\n- Start with `/althing` in Desktop or Web chat. Ask the moderator to propose an agenda for your topic.\n- Convene a panel from the harnesses and models available on your Host. Pick the Host’s collaboration defaults or assign agents, models, thinking levels and roles in the wizard or expert roster.\n- Follow opening statements, peer critiques and rebuttals in the agenda discussion. Open a delegated thread to inspect its work.\n- Publish agenda conclusions and final reports. Download a standalone publication or transfer the complete council as a portable ZIP.",
    "zh-CN": "### 在议事厅中\n\n- 在桌面或网页聊天框输入 `/althing` 发起会议，可请主持模型按主题拟订议程。\n- 从本机可用的智能体和模型中选出专家与主持人，可一键加入已就绪的协作专家，也可在向导或专家名册中手动配置 Agent、模型、推理强度和会议角色。\n- 按议程跟进独立分析、交叉质询与反驳，打开子会话查看实时进展。\n- 发布议程结论和总报告，下载独立出版物，或通过 ZIP 在不同主机之间迁移完整议题。"
  },
  "author": "mythezone",
  "categories": ["workflow", "tools"],
  "settingsSchema": [
    {
      "key": "dataDir",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Local data directory (empty for Host default)",
        "zh-CN": "本地数据目录（留空使用宿主默认位置）"
      },
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "showProjectAlthingItems",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "Show project councils in sidebar",
        "zh-CN": "在侧栏项目下显示议会"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "sidebarAlthingVisibility",
      "type": "select",
      "label": { "en": "Top-level Desktop sidebar entry", "zh-CN": "桌面侧栏顶部议事厅入口" },
      "default": "active",
      "options": [
        { "value": "active", "label": { "en": "Only during active councils", "zh-CN": "仅在有议题讨论时显示" } },
        { "value": "always", "label": { "en": "Always show", "zh-CN": "始终显示" } },
        { "value": "hidden", "label": { "en": "Always hide", "zh-CN": "始终隐藏" } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "defaultProtocol",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Default protocol",
        "zh-CN": "默认议事协议"
      },
      "default": "council-standard",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "council-standard",
          "label": {
            "en": "Standard Council",
            "zh-CN": "标准议会"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "adversarial-debate",
          "label": {
            "en": "Adversarial Debate",
            "zh-CN": "对抗辩论"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "rapid-panel",
          "label": {
            "en": "Rapid Panel",
            "zh-CN": "快速评议"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "defaultTheme",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Default theme",
        "zh-CN": "默认主题"
      },
      "default": "auto",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": {
            "en": "Automatic",
            "zh-CN": "自动"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "editorial-paper",
          "label": {
            "en": "Editorial Paper",
            "zh-CN": "编辑纸页"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "cool-slate",
          "label": {
            "en": "Cool Slate",
            "zh-CN": "冷灰石板"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "obsidian-night",
          "label": {
            "en": "Obsidian Night",
            "zh-CN": "黑曜之夜"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "externalEndpoint",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Local API endpoint (empty to discover)",
        "zh-CN": "本机 API 地址（留空自动发现）"
      },
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "clientToken",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Client token (empty for local CLI credentials)",
        "zh-CN": "客户端令牌（留空读取本地 CLI 凭据）"
      },
      "default": ""
    }
  ],
  "page": {
    "apiVersion": 1,
    "entry": "page/index.mjs",
    "title": {
      "en": "The Althing",
      "zh-CN": "议事厅"
    },
    "style": "page/style.css"
  },
  "web": {
    "apiVersion": 1,
    "entry": "web/index.mjs",
    "style": "web/style.css"
  },
  "desktop": {
    "apiVersion": 1,
    "script": "desktop/index.js",
    "style": "desktop/style.css"
  },
  "backend": {
    "apiVersion": 1,
    "entry": "backend/index.mjs"
  },
  "repository": "https://github.com/mythezone/codexhost-ext-the-althing",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "screenshots": [
    "assets/screenshots/hub.webp",
    "assets/screenshots/overview.webp",
    "assets/screenshots/discussion.webp",
    "assets/screenshots/report-reader.webp"
  ]
}
